Build the help pages only when itstool is available.

The user manual is translated with itstool at build time; without it on the
build machine, configuration stops. Skip the help in that case.

Upstream-Status: QNX-specific

--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -151,7 +151,10 @@
                       language: 'c')
 
 subdir('data')
-subdir('help')
+# The help pages are built with itstool, a build-host tool that may be absent.
+if find_program('itstool', required : false).found()
+  subdir('help')
+endif
 subdir('po')
 subdir('third-party')
 subdir('lib')
